# 换行符统一：无论谁在什么系统检出，仓库内文本文件一律 LF，避免 CRLF 噪音与 diff 污染
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确声明二进制文件，禁止任何换行/编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
